---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Margdarshak Shikshan Sansthan"
  description="Learn how Margdarshak Shikshan Sansthan collects, uses, and protects your personal information when you visit our website or contact us."
>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-slate-50 py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top,_rgba(229,57,53,0.10),_transparent_38%),radial-gradient(circle_at_bottom_right,_rgba(255,179,0,0.12),_transparent_30%)]"></div>

    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 md:px-6">
      <div class="mb-10 text-center">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-secondary/20 bg-secondary/5 px-4 py-2 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-secondary">
          Legal Information
        </span>
        <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-primary md:text-6xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base text-slate-600 md:text-lg">
          Effective date: 18 September 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_15px_40px_rgba(7,20,38,0.04)] md:p-10">
        <div class="space-y-8 text-slate-700">
          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-primary">1. Introduction</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              Margdarshak Shikshan Sansthan ("we", "our", or "us") respects your privacy and is committed to protecting
              personal information shared with us through our website, forms, phone calls, WhatsApp messages, or other
              communication channels.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
              This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, how we protect it, and the choices
              you have regarding your personal data.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-primary">2. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">We may collect the following information when you interact with our website or services:</p>
            <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-relaxed">
              <li>Name, phone number, email address, and city or location.</li>
              <li>Course or internship interest and admission-related information.</li>
              <li>Messages sent through our contact forms, WhatsApp, or phone calls.</li>
              <li>Website usage data, including browser type, device information, pages visited, and referral data.</li>
              <li>Cookies and analytics data used to improve user experience and site performance.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-primary">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">We use your personal data to:</p>
            <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-relaxed">
              <li>Respond to admissions, course, and internship inquiries.</li>
              <li>Provide updates about programs, fees, and student support.</li>
              <li>Communicate with you through phone, WhatsApp, email, or other approved channels.</li>
              <li>Improve our website, content, and student experience.</li>
              <li>Ensure compliance with legal and operational requirements.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-primary">4. Sharing of Information</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              We do not sell or rent your personal information. We may share your information only with trusted service
              providers or authorized personnel when necessary to operate our services, such as communication, analytics,
              or technical support.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
              We may also disclose personal data if required by law, court order, government regulation, or to protect the
              rights, safety, or property of Margdarshak Shikshan Sansthan and its students.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-primary">5. Cookies and Analytics</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              Our website may use cookies and similar technologies to understand traffic, improve performance, and provide
              a better browsing experience. These tools help us measure how users navigate the site and which pages are
              most useful.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
              You can usually disable cookies in your browser settings if you prefer. Please note that some features of the
              website may work less effectively if cookies are turned off.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-primary">6. Data Security</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              We take reasonable steps to protect personal data from unauthorized access, misuse, alteration, or loss.
              However, no method of digital communication or storage is completely risk-free, and we cannot guarantee
              absolute security.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-primary">7. Your Rights</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">You may have the right to:</p>
            <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-relaxed">
              <li>Request access to the personal information we hold about you.</li>
              <li>Request correction of inaccurate or incomplete information.</li>
              <li>Ask us to delete or restrict certain personal information, subject to legal limitations.</li>
              <li>Opt out of non-essential communications at any time.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
              To exercise these rights, please contact us using the details below.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-primary">8. Third-Party Links</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              Our website may contain links to third-party websites or tools. We are not responsible for the privacy practices
              of those external sites and encourage you to review their privacy policies before sharing any personal
              information.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-primary">9. Contact Us</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or your data, please contact us:</p>
            <div class="mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              <p><strong>Margdarshak Shikshan Sansthan</strong></p>
              <p>VIP Road, Benta Chowk, Laheriasarai, Darbhanga</p>
              <p>Phone: +91 92290 25257</p>
              <p>Email: info@margdarshakedu.com</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-primary">10. Policy Updates</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              We may update this Privacy Policy occasionally to reflect changes in our services, legal requirements, or
              operational practices. Any revised policy will be posted on this page with the updated effective date.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
